OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Children's Booker prize
OL,4,Areveals shortlist - and its child
OL,5,Ajudges
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe first ever Children's Booker Prize
OL,8,Fhas announced the eight books in the
OL,9,Frunning for the new #50,000 award.
OL,11,FFive novels, two graphic novels and an
OL,12,Fillustrated collection of short stories
OL,13,Fare on the shortlist, which is aimed at
OL,14,Fchildren aged eight to 12.
OL,16,FThe authors in contention include
OL,17,Fformer Children's Laureate of Ireland
OL,18,FEoin Colfer, who is best known for his
OL,19,FArtemis Fowl series, and teacher and
OL,20,Fchildren's author Catherine Bruton.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
