OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Children's Booker prize
OL,4,Areveals shortlist - and its child
OL,5,Ajudges
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour children have also been announced
OL,8,Fas new judges after a UK-wide
OL,9,Fcompetition. Twelve-year-old Ibrahim
OL,10,Ffrom Hampshire was one of those picked
OL,11,Ffrom more than 4,000 entrants.
